<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Printing Ink -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Printing Ink -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.31		vs	   26.18</p>
<p> Operating	  765    million	  vs	  762    million</p>
<p> Current	    830    million	  vs	  787    million</p>
<p> Net		  300    million	  vs	  294    million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.03 yen	  vs	   10.79 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  27 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Printing Ink MFG Co Ltd is a medium-ranking maker of printing ink and colouring agents.</p>
</text>
